description:
Compile all 319 spells into clause-complete procedures.

Root cause: spell projection captures headers and a small mechanics summary, so
area geometry, projectile counts, ordered allocation, staged effects, and
termination remain prose.

Required membership — all of:
- all point-origin and target-origin area geometry (main @4384f25: only 16 spells
  carry mechanics.area; 68 more describe areas in prose only, including fireball
  and cloudkill);
- Magic Missile projectile count, targeting, automatic hit, and simultaneity;
- pools and ordered allocation such as Sleep and Color Spray;
- multi-stage spells, repeat saves/checks, secondary checks, tables, counters,
  entity lifecycle, movement, termination, and upcast bases;
- all exact spell examples and candidate memberships from the four reviews;
- the 9 spells whose prose states a half-damage success branch with no typed
  success field (shared predicate with A2), e.g. spell:blade-barrier,
  spell:control-water, spell:earthquake;
- honest handling of the Animal Friendship source corruption (with B1).

Closes findings: SOL-005, F-08, F-11, CAP-003, CAP-009, Fable F2.
